  "rules": [
    "Preserve all existing ENDFIELD graphics, both solid and hatched. The explicit protected rectangle is not an exhaustive list of every ENDFIELD logo.",
    "SUKHOI appears in one texture inscription region only (nose); repeated UV may display it more than once on the aircraft.",
    "Keep full SU-30SM / SU-30SM2 model labels and short 30SM / 30SM2 identifiers.",
    "IRKUTSK AVIATION PLANT names the production plant; these markings are an artistic skin layout, not a claimed real service paint scheme.",
    "Do not transfer rectangles or polygon clipping to other aircraft without checking physical surfaces.",
    "Do not edit native XYZ, UV or structural normal channels G/A. R/B material changes require a separate scope and check.",
    "For unknown locations, use a separate disposable multiscale color-block/number/direction probe and inspect all sides. Never leave probes in delivery textures."
  ],
